A('1961-0101-trangbang', '1961-01-01', VH, 'Tây Ninh. Ten thousand women of the communes march to the district seat of Trảng Bàng, Jan. 1, soldiers\' families of the Saigon army among them.', 'III, 139', place='trang-bang', also=['vietnam'])
A('1961-0117-teachers', '1961-01-17', VH, 'Saigon. Thousands of teachers and pupils of the big schools demonstrate, Jan. 17, for lower fees at the private schools and better pay for teachers.', 'III, 143', place='saigon', also=['vietnam'])
A('1961-02-region5', '1961-02', VH, 'Interzone V\'s committee and Region 5\'s command decide in February to mobilize all forces to attack the Saigon side, hold the forests and mountains, build the bases and win back the plains. Thừa Thiên\'s forces strike sweeps at Nam Đông, Đá Mộc, Hòa Mỹ and Route 4 and on the Bồ and Ô Lâu rivers that month; in Quảng Trị the guerrillas besiege and call on isolated posts to surrender.', 'III, 141', when='Feb.', vis=True, also=OP, check='the day and the place of the decision.', tags=['ok:fields-place'])
A('1961-0217-vimytex', '1961-02-17', VH, 'Saigon. Eight hundred workers of the Vimytex textile firm, a joint firm of Diệm\'s circle and the American Johnson company, strike, Feb. 17, for working conditions in line with the labor law.', 'III, 186', place='saigon', names=['Ngô Đình Diệm'], also=['vietnam'], check='the history gives "17-2-1961" in a passage on the strikes of 1962; the year is the history\'s.')
A('1961-04-election', '1961-04', VH, 'Region 5. The people boycott Diệm\'s rigged "presidential election" in April: in Gia Lai the people of 600 hamlets under the Saigon side stay away and burn their voters\' cards.', 'III, 144', when='Apr.', names=['Ngô Đình Diệm'], place='gia-lai', also=['vietnam'], check='the day.')
A('1961-09-mocay', '1961-09', VH, 'Bến Tre. In September Saigon opens a "pacification and amnesty" campaign centered on Mỏ Cày, against the freed area and the bases.', 'III, 158', when='Sept.', place='ben-tre', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1961-09-cuuloi', '1961-09', VH, 'Ninh Thuận. Battalion 120 of Region 6 destroys the Cửu Lợi post in Cam Lâm district in September. In October it joins Khánh Hòa\'s troops against the Saigon side at Cấm Sơn; at the end of the year half of it goes to northern Ninh Thuận.', 'III, 162', when='Sept.', place='cam-lam', also=OP, check='the day; the October fight at Cấm Sơn and the year-end move are the history\'s next sentences, not entered separately.', tags=['ok:fields-at'])
A('1962-0209-q761', '1962-02-09', VH, 'Tây Ninh. Battalions 1 and 2 and their attached units, brought to full strength, hold the formal ceremony of Q761 at Trảng Dài, Feb. 9, and the regiment takes the name of the 1st Infantry Regiment.', 'III, 47', place='tay-ninh', vis=True, also=OP, check='the history gives the battalions\' first ceremony at Dương Minh Châu as "9-2-1961", before the regiment\'s founding in July 1961 (III, 47): a misprint for 1962 or for another day.')
A('1963-02-offensiveplan', '1963-02', 'vietnam', 'After Ấp Bắc the Americans and Saigon decide on a "general offensive plan", carried out from February 1963.', 'III, 263', when='Feb.', tags=['polity:rvn', 'ok:fields-at', 'ok:fields-place'], check='the history\'s name; the American record not matched; the day.')
A('1963-03-ducthang23', '1963-03-19', VH, 'Kiến Tường. Saigon opens operation Đức Thắng 23, Mar. 19, a large operation of many months, first on the south of Mộc Hóa district and from June 20 along the Năm Ngàn canal.', 'III, 273', place='moc-hoa', also=OP, check='June 20, the second thrust, is the history\'s second date for the operation.')
A('1963-04-bn95', '1963-04', VH, 'Quảng Ngãi. In April Battalion 95 of Region 5\'s Regiment 2 fights a sweep in the west of the province: 110 killed or wounded of its own, 60 infantry weapons and some military gear lost.', 'III, 255', when='Apr.', place='quang-ngai-province', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1963-0601-binhthuan', '1963-06-01', VH, 'Bình Thuận. A large operation of the Saigon army\'s main forces begins, June 1.', 'III, 260', place='binh-thuan', also=OP)
A('1963-1028-phanthiet', '1963-10-28', VH, 'Bình Thuận. Troops and guerrillas ambush an armored column sweeping toward Phan Thiết, Oct. 28: one carrier and dozens of men destroyed, 50 weapons taken; then they stay to help the people of the villages outside the town rise.', 'III, 261', place='phan-thiet', also=OP)
A('1964-0401-chienthang', '1964-04-01', 'vietnam', 'The Saigon–American pacification plan "Chiến Thắng" (Victory) takes effect, Apr. 1: the first step to Dec. 3, 1965, pacification by priority in tactical zones I, II and III by continuous sweeps with the moving of the people into "new life hamlets"; the second, from 1966, attacks on the base areas to destroy the Liberation Army\'s main units.', 'III, 334–35', tags=['polity:rvn', 'ok:fields-place'], also=OP, check='the American record: Chiến Thắng, in the calendar at [[cal.1964-04-01.vietnam]]; the history\'s account of the plan\'s two steps.')
